  "details": "<p>The <em>tribus Horatia </em>may be connected with the patrician <em>gens Horatia. </em>The territory of the tribe is uncertain, although it may be linked to Alba Longa. Aricia was enrolled in this <em>tribus </em>in the fourth century B.C.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The tribus Horatia was a rural tribe of ancient Rome.",
